# The public site on Coolify (application "landing-web", port 8080, domain https://callerwhale.com). Paste into Developer View. In Coolify tick "Available during build" for this variable: it is read when the site is built, not when it runs.
# Build-time public auth service address embedded in the browser JavaScript, like https://auth.callerwhale.com. Rebuild to change; it is not a secret. Wrong value breaks every sign-in.
VITE_CALLERWHALE_AUTH_URL=https://auth.callerwhale.com
# Public gateway address for the contact form. Available during build.
VITE_CALLERWHALE_GATEWAY_URL=https://gate.callerwhale.com
